In article <1992Mar4.234014.26817@beaver.cs.washington.edu> pullen@cs.washington.edu (Walter D. Pullen) writes:

$ It's always been my dream to find a super bones pile, like from
$ someone who has just raided the castle. Unfortunately, such bones
$ piles are always way down in the dungeon and by the time I get there I
$ already have the stuff I need. I've often been tempted to *make* such
$ a pile by intentionally killing one of my awesome characters on level
$ 4, and then pick up the bones pile with a new wimpy character. However
$ the 1/3 chance always has made me turn this option down and go on to
$ try for demigodhood.

You can have 100% certainty of creating a bones file if you use wizard
mode. Just go down to level 4, wish for lots of goodies such are +100
stormbringer and +100 scale mail. Drop all your stuff and get killed, 
then when the game asks whether to create a bone file select yes. You
can also create lots of monsters eg black dragons, medusas and minotaurs
to create a hard level. This is of course abuse of the worst form and 
i would never use it since it takes all the challenge out of the game.


